\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\fs24 Commissioner Thomas shared the recently sworn in president of the National Association of Counties (NACo) is from North Carolina. President George Dunlap is the third NACo president from North Carolina. She offered her congratulations.  She shared Commissioners Mial, Jackson and Waters were in attendance at NACo.  She shared she serves as the Vice-Chair of Large Urban County Caucus, and is the Chair of Telecommunications and Technology for the third year.  \par
\par
Commissioner Waters acknowledged community partners and leaders who have invested in the public schools through various events to help start the school year with the necessary resources needed. She wished a successful school year for educators and students.  \cf2\par
}

